+Remaining physical boundary: logs show repeated `Rescue response session
+binding is invalid`, followed by duplicate-installation session replacement
+and `Relay transport session is inactive`. C-to-A display alone does not
+prove three-node Chat traversal. Reply reception at C and successful current
+incident Offer binding remain NOT VERIFIED. The self-recipient guard has
+not yet been built/deployed in this investigation.
